  `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 .venv/bin/python -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p 'test_stage11_t07_evaluation.py' -v`
  Result: PASS, 17 tests. An initial assertion had an incorrect hand-computed
  model net-benefit expectation; corrected the test to `TP/N - FP/N * pt/(1-pt)`;
  the full suite then passed. Matplotlib used a temporary cache because its
